              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe melixie consumes a large quantity of sugar, honey, nectar, or similar sweets and goes into a frenzied state. The melixie immediately Strides or Flies.\n\nFor the next 1d4+1 rounds, the melixie is quickened, and can use the additional action only to Stride or Fly. As soon as the rush ends, the melixie is fatigued for 1 minute."
